    <briefdescription>
<para>Type-erased wrapper for metadata values. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides type introspection and safe casting for metadata retrieved without knowing the type ahead of time. Eliminates the need for type guessing loops. </para>
